  Version 3, open access, CC BY 4.0, no application or credential required.
  DOI 10.7937/TCIA.HMQ8-J677
  https://www.cancerimagingarchive.net/collection/nlst/
  Used in this release for encoder pretraining only.

LIDC-IDRI, TCIA
  Version 4, open access, CC BY 3.0, no application or credential required.
  DOI 10.7937/K9/TCIA.2015.LO9QL9SX
  https://www.cancerimagingarchive.net/collection/lidc-idri/
  Used in this release for nodule and segmentation pretraining only.

LUNA16 release, Zenodo record 3723295
  Version 3, open access, CC BY 4.0, no application or credential required.
  DOI 10.5281/zenodo.3723295
  https://zenodo.org/records/3723295
  Used in this release for nodule-detection pretraining only.

Learn2Reg CT lung registration data, Zenodo record 3835682
  Version 1, open access, CC BY 4.0, no application or credential required.
  DOI 10.5281/zenodo.3835682
