--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Clinical cohorts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The development, prospective, external-validation and calibration cohorts are
held by the originating clinical sites. They are anonymised, are not
redistributed here, and remain available only from the data holders under a
data-use agreement. No individual-level clinical data ship with this release.
